'''Dwarven O's Metallic Minis''' are a {{Legendary}} [[Consumable]]. They are obtained from looting [[Frozen Corpses]] in the {{Zone|Glacite Mineshafts}}. 

== Obtaining ==
'''Dwarven O's Metallic Minis''' have a {{Green|0.31%}} chance to drop from {{DarkRed|Umber}} and {{Gray|Tungsten}} [[Frozen Corpses]], and a {{Green|3.41%}} chance to drop from Vanguard Corpses.

== Usage ==
'''Dwarven O's Metalic Minis''' can be consumed up to {{Green|5}} times. Each '''Dwarven O's Metallic Minis''' eaten permanently increases the player's {{Stat|dwarven metal fortune}} by {{Stat|dwarven metal fortune|+2|icononly=yes}}, up to {{Stat|dwarven metal fortune|+10}}.

